From 09e7456d03c08b5ea6cfc6e5e0de263d571674e7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xilin Wu <sophon@radxa.com>
Date: Thu, 14 May 2026 14:49:45 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 794/820] RADXA: drm/msm/dp: Program DSC PPS, DTO and FEC

Signed-off-by: Mingcong Bai <jeffbai@aosc.io>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dp/dp_ctrl.c  | 137 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dp/dp_panel.c | 127 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++
